  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> Grenade and Rocket Launchers</p>\n<p><em>Contrary to popular belief, Militech grenadiers prefer precision strikes. Not because it causes less collateral damage, it just saves on ammo.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Requires Smartgun Link or Smart Scope with an installed Targeting Scope.</strong> When firing an explosive from the weapon which deals damage, the user may choose to suffer a -4 penalty to their Attack Check. If the attack is successful and incurs a Critical Injury, the victim(s) suffer a random Critical Injury to their Head instead of the Body Location.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Grips &amp; Controls).</em></p>"
